In response to reviewers' questions and suggestions, we have made changes to the version of our paper available on OpenReview. We highlight the following changes:
- New pseudolabeling result added to Table 1;
- **Practical considerations** section added as Appendix A, discussing batching, loss function selection, and symmetry-breaking concerns;
- **Expanded discussion of related work** added as Appendix B.
